      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gog paka gima Were oro",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 38:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwoth oluwo kodan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.38.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.38.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 38:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.20.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Meny 20:8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Owaco ni wod dhano, com waŋin kwoŋ Gog, ma piny ma Magog, wod kere madwoŋ pa Mesek kodi Tubal. Tuci kwoŋe wac paran ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.38.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.38.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 38:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aka iwaci ni: Rwoth Were waco ama: Amon kodin, awi Gog, wod kere madwoŋ pa Mesek kodi Tubal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.38.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.38.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 38:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alatimin awira awira t'aketho siragetere i pom lakin, t'afudhin woko gi jolweny perin je, kayinin kodi joma gweyo, kareno joje joruko ruk ma lweny, kitipa madwoŋ, joje gi kwot aka jotiŋo abor. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.38.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.38.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 38:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pasia, Ethopiya, kodi Libia jonitie gi jo, joje gi kwot kodi abor. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.38.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.38.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 38:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Goma gi jolweny mere je; Bethtogarma wok iy'adec mabor ma yumalo gi jolweny mere je, ji kweth jonitie gi win.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.38.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.38.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 38:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.38.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.38.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 38:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yikere win, bedi win ma wiyikere, win kodi kitipin je ma jowura jothoko win, aka wicungi matek rijo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.38.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.38.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 38:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka hongo okadho m'oromo ilalwoŋo win; i oro ma rumacen, wilakidho monjo piny kama ji oyido jodwok'iye wok i nonin kweth aka jotieko bedo ma jokilwor lweny wi gote ma Isiraili, m'oyido otiek jwango oro kweth; to pama onyo ji jobed'iye m'ongoye teko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.38.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.38.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 38:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wilamedere woth, wilabino pa koyo madwoŋ; wilabedo pa pondeponde ma umo piny, win kodi jolweny mewin je, kodi ji kweth ma jonitie gi win.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.38.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.38.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 38:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.38.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.38.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 38:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwoth Were waco ama: I ndelo no paro labino i cunyin, aka ilatimo can marac. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.38.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.38.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 38:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilawaco ni, “Alakidho lweny gi calin ma k'ogoy'iye cel; alapodho kwoŋ ji ma joliŋ ma jobedo kam'ongoye teko, joje ma jobedo kama k'ogoy'iye cel, aka jongoye gi nyweny kosa waŋkace.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.38.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.38.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 38:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wilamako to winyaga ji ma jobedo kam'oyido cango obedo gundin. Ji m'ocok jo wok i nonin, ma onyo jocako limo dhok gi lim, ma jobedo i dier piny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.38.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.38.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 38:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Seba kodi Dedan kodi jomitan ma Tarsis kodi simbwore mere ma nyaka joay jolapenjo win ni, “Wibino kinyaga? Witieko coko kitipa mewin ma tiŋo gim'onyaga, ma tiŋo feza kodi buban, ma kwanyo woko dhok kodi lim, ma kinyaga lim kweth?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.38.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.38.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 38:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.38.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.38.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 38:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Riameno, wod dhano, tuci wac paran, aka iwaci ri Gog ni: Rwoth Were waco ama: I ndelo no ka ji paran Isiraili jobedo kam'okwe, ilaay ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.38.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.38.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 38:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "t'ibino wok i kabedo perin iy'adec mabor ma yumalo, in kodi ji kweth ma jonitie kodin, joje kareno jogweyo kayinin kweth ma kiwacere, jolweny ma jomeni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.38.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.38.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 38:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilabino lweny gi ji paran Isiraili, paka pondeponde ma umo piny. I hongo ma yuwaŋe, alakelin i cingan ŋey nonin jonyal ŋeyan, kareno joluwo kwoŋin, awi Gog, alanyutho leŋo ruwaŋ jo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.38.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.38.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gir'acula pa Were ri Gog",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 38:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.38.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.38.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 38:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwoth Were waco ama: In a ŋat'atieko luwo kwoŋe i hongo m'okadho gi ŋecin paran jotuci wac Were ma Isiraili, ma i hongo no jotuco wac paran ma oro kweth ni oyido alakelin lweny gi jo? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.38.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.38.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 38:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I ndelo no, ka Gog ocako lweny gi piny ma Isiraili, Rwoth Were waco, keme paran lakigaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.38.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.38.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 38:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rupiri i nyeko paran kodi i keme paran maliel atieko luwo: I ndelo no yengirok pa piny madwoŋ labedo i piny ma Isiraili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.38.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.38.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 38:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rec ma nam, kodi winyin ma koyo, kodi ogwaŋe madudi, kodi gigipiny ma mol gi kor jo i lowo, kodi ji je ma jonitie i piny, jobino kirin i nyiman, aka ilawito gote piny, aka acurcur jolapodho piny, aka kisi kor ot lapodho piny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.38.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.38.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 38:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alalwoŋo abor kwoŋ Gog i gote paran je, Rwoth Were waco. Abor labedo kwoŋ omin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.38.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.38.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 38:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alathumo rigo banja gi two nundu kodi nek; alamiyo koth wocwe gi pe, mac kodi tele laoy kwoŋe, jolweny pere kodi ji kweth ma jonitie gi go. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.38.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.38.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 38:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ameno alanyutho dwoŋ paran gi leŋo paran, t'anyuthere i waŋ nonin kweth. Nyaka to joŋeyo ni An Abedo Rwoth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.38.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.38.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
